         alternatives system offers only the Java 17 launcher.
      c. A bounded filesystem search for a JDK 8 home found none, and a version
         probe of every executable java binary discovered on the host returned
         Java 17 in every case.
      d. Neither a build output directory nor a surefire report directory
         exists anywhere in the module, so there was also no earlier report
         available to relocate.
    A Java 17 run was NOT substituted for the missing one. A report produced on
    Java 17 is a MIGRATED capture, and filing one under the baseline tree would
    mislabel it - the most damaging fabrication available here.
    A JDK 8 was NOT installed to change any of this: R-1 forbids adding tooling
    without a justification, and R-6 forbids repairing a pre-existing
